        "pseudocode": "CONSTRUCT_WITNESSES(m, L, b, n):\n  b_min \u2190 min(b)\n  for i: w[i] \u2190 b[i] - b_min\n  verify: w[i] \u2265 0, w[i] \u2264 m[i]/L[i]\n  Global radius: \u03b5 = min_i(m[i]/L[i])\nComplexity: O(n) time",
